# Production-Ready AI Virtual Try-On (VTO) Feature

## 🎯 Executive Summary & Confirmation
**হ্যাঁ, এই ফিচারটি সম্পূর্ণ এবং প্রডাকশন-গ্রেড কোয়ালিটিতে আপনার প্ল্যাটফর্মে ইমপ্লিমেন্ট করা সম্ভব!** (Yes, this feature can definitely be built to production-ready standards for your e-commerce platform).

This plan outlines the end-to-end architecture and implementation for the **AI Virtual Try-On (VTO)** feature, specifically tailored for upper-body apparel (T-shirts, shirts, hoodies, jackets) and extensible to all clothing categories. It guarantees a luxury user experience, seamless cart integration, mobile-first camera capture, privacy-first zero-retention image processing, and a pluggable backend AI provider layer (supporting Replicate IDM-VTON / Kolors, Fashn.ai, Fal.ai, and custom models).

