## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **AI Provider Selection & API Keys:**
> The backend architecture will use a provider strategy pattern configurable via environment variables (`VIRTUAL_TRYON_PROVIDER=replicate|fashn|fal|mock`, `VIRTUAL_TRYON_API_KEY=...`).
> - If you already have an API key for Replicate, Fashn.ai, or Fal.ai, you can plug it into `.env`.
> - If no API key is provided immediately during local testing, the system automatically falls back to an intelligent development simulation engine so you can test the full UI/UX flow without errors or costs.

> [!NOTE]
> **Privacy Policy & Customer Trust:**
> Customer uploaded/captured photos are never stored in the database or permanent cloud buckets. They are processed ephemerally and discarded immediately after generation.

