## Proposed Changes

### 1. Backend Architecture (`zebalpha-backend`)

#### [NEW] `src/services/vto/providers/VirtualTryOnProvider.js`
- Abstract base provider class defining `generateTryOn({ personImage, garmentImage, category, productId, options })`.

#### [NEW] `src/services/vto/providers/ReplicateVTOProvider.js`
- Implements integration with Replicate VTO models (such as `cuuupid/idm-vton` or `viktorfa/ootdiffusion`). Handles prediction creation, polling/webhook, and returning result URL.

#### [NEW] `src/services/vto/providers/FashnVTOProvider.js`
- Implements integration with Fashn.ai API (`https://api.fashn.ai/v1/run`).

#### [NEW] `src/services/vto/providers/FalVTOProvider.js`
- Implements integration with Fal.ai Virtual Try-On APIs.

#### [NEW] `src/services/vto/providers/MockVTOProvider.js`
- Safe local testing provider providing realistic realistic responses when running without third-party API credits.

#### [NEW] `src/services/vto/VirtualTryOnService.js`
- Core service coordinator: selects active provider based on environment variables, normalizes requests, validates inputs, and ensures zero permanent data retention.

#### [NEW] `src/controllers/virtualTryOnController.js`
